A daily breakfast buffet is served in the restaurant 7:00–10:30 am, parking is free on the basement level, and the hotel has a café. Check-in is from 4:00 pm and check-out by 12:00 noon. Reception and in-room dining are available around the clock, and you can reach reception directly on WhatsApp before arrival or during your stay. Rooms are cleaned daily between 10:00 am and 5:00 pm.$c$),
